Z||000000||gkozlov||11-22-2000||05:21 PM||||I was driving home from work when I saw this. At first I was concerned about the safety and well-being of the driver. I pulled over and the driver was ok.<P>She had run out of gas and pulled of the road and gotten out of the car. The car then rolled into this position.<P>My Fiero is in the pic so it must be safe to post this here. If you guys and gals want more pics let me know. I didnt want to post if no one is intrested.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Image7.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sign1_3.jpg">   <BR><A HREF="http://g.kozlov.tripod.com/gkozlov.htm" TARGET=_blank>GKozlovs Fiero Site</A><p>[This message has been edited by gkozlov (edited 11-22-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||fropuff||11-22-2000||05:42 PM||||How did it make it over that huge gap?  That's funny.  Poor Tempo!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Didn't she know that "park" and e-brakes are made just to prevent that?  You can post more if you want.  <P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
